{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29770","headline":"灵仙阁晚眺寄郓州韦评事 · 李商隐","name":"灵仙阁晚眺寄郓州韦评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚公方住谷，仁者本依山。\n共誓林泉志，胡爲尊俎间。\n华莲开菡萏，荆玉刻孱颜。\n爽气临周道，岚光入汉关。\n满壶徒蚁泛，高阁已苔斑。\n想就安车召，宁期负矢还。\n潘游全璧散，郭去半舟闲。\n定笑幽人迹，鸿轩不可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}